<newsitem itemid="24520" id="root" date="1996-08-30" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: SEB reports flat H1 profit.</title>
<headline>SEB reports flat H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     121  vs	     122</p>
<p>    Operating					340  vs	     310</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					  192  vs	     194</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   295  vs	     259</p>
<p>    Interest expense				45  vs		51</p>
<p>    Turnover				     4,387  vs	   4,054</p>
<p>NOTE - Electrical appliance manufacturer SEB reiterated in its first-half earnings statement a prediction made at the shareholders meeting that net attributable profit for the full year could attain 500 million francs.</p>
<p>Its brands include Calor, Rowenta and Tefal as well as SEB.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
